{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>פדה</b> Two times in the Masorah: אך פדה תפדה and the other אח לא פדה יפדה. This is what Rabbi Yehoshua said: a ewe that did not give first birth and bore two males — both go to the priest, and one does not exempt the other. And that is אח לא פדה יפדה."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:29.809659126Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}